    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your territory</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 30 types of buildings</li><li>More than 10 production lines</li><li>More than 50 types of technologies</li><li>More than 100 types of commodities</li><li>Real villager life</li><li>Detailed villager occupations</li><li>Automated construction </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lead the army in battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 30 types of soldiers</li><li>More than 30 cities</li><li>Challenging AI opponents</li><li>Rich diplomatic activities</li><li>Personally command the army</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your territory</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 30 types of buildings</li><li>More than 10 production lines</li><li>More than 50 types of technologies</li><li>More than 100 types of commodities</li><li>Real villager life</li><li>Detailed villager occupations</li><li>Automated construction </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lead the army in battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 30 types of soldiers</li><li>More than 30 cities</li><li>Challenging AI opponents</li><li>Rich diplomatic activities</li><li>Personally command the army</li></ul>",
